<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-liangshu" book-id="b-liangshu-043" chapter-id="c-liangshu-043-collective-commentary" source-id="s-liangshu-043-collective-commentary-ws2087360">
  <p id="c-liangshu-043-collective-commentary:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">史臣曰：若夫義重於生，前典垂誥，斯蓋先哲之所貴也。故<persName id="c-liangshu-043-collective-commentary:p001:m0026" ref="saz_old_5fi">孟子</persName>稱生者我所欲，義亦我所欲，二事必不可兼得，寧捨生而取義。至如<persName id="c-liangshu-043-collective-commentary:p001:m0058" ref="ant_dk4_dds_B">張嵊</persName>二三子之徒，捐軀殉節，赴死如歸，英風勁氣，籠罩今古，君子知梁代之有忠臣焉。</p>
</text>
